Widevine CDM implementation
===========================

This package is a dependency-free reimplementation of the Widevine CDM flow
(device .wvd loading, privacy-mode license challenge generation and license
parsing) written for this add-on. It follows the same protocol and data
structures as the original `pywidevine` project:

    https://github.com/devine-dl/pywidevine   (GPL-3.0-only)

Credit for the reference implementation and the reverse-engineered protocol
belongs to that project and its contributors. The protobuf message definitions
mirror Google Widevine's `license_protocol.proto`.

This reimplementation is distributed under the same license as the rest of this
add-on (GNU GPL v3, see the repository-level LICENSE.txt), which is compatible
with pywidevine's GPL-3.0 terms.
